    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lär Ko-rɛc kɛ loc ji̱ Juudh jɔk",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö bi ruac Kuɔth Nhial ëë cɛ lat kɛ thok Yir-mɛ-yaa a thuɔ̱k, kɛ ruɔ̱n Ko-rɛc kuäär Pa-rath in nhiam, cu Kuoth Nhial Ko-rɛc kuäär Pa-rath jak kä latdɛ ruac rɛy kuäärädɛ kɛɛliw, kä cuɛ jɛ gɔ̱ri,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nɛmɛ ɛ min ci Ko-rɛc kuäär Pa-rath ɛ lar. Ci Kuoth Nhial Kuoth puɔ̱rä, ɣä ka̱m kuäär wec muɔ̱ɔ̱n kɛɛliw, kä cɛ ɣä ka̱m ɣöö bä la̱t luak kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kä Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ramɔ te rɛydun ɔ kä nɛɛkɛ diaal, a Kuothdɛ te kɛɛl kɛ jɛ, kä a jɛ wä kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kä Juda, kä a nyɔk luak Kuɔth Nhial Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl kɛ ta̱th ɛ jɛn Kuoth in te kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛy tin ci duɔth a tëk gua̱thni tɔ̱ cieŋkɛ thi̱n ɔ, akɛ lua̱kɛ ɛ nɛy tin cieŋ kɛɛl kɛ kɛ, kɛ ciɛk in bo̱r kɛnɛ da̱a̱p, kɛ kuak, kɛ ley. A /ci muc tɛthkä lɔaac kɛ kui̱ luak Kuɔth in te kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm te thi̱n.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä a bööth thuɔk duel Juda kɛnɛ Ben-ya-min, kɛ bööth palä, kɛ ji̱ Lii-bay, kɛ ramɔ ci Kuoth lɔcdɛ liɛc ɔ rialkɛ rɔ ikä, ba luak Kuɔth Nhial in te kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm wä nyɔk kɛ ta̱th. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ thieekädiɛn kɛ moc kɛ kuak cikä min bo̱r kɛnɛ da̱a̱p kɛ kuak kɛ ley kɛ kuak ti di̱t kökdiɛn, a/ci muc tɛthkä lɔaac diaal te thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär ni Ko-rɛc kuak luaak Kuɔth Nhial tëë ca naŋ ɛ Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kä cɛ la̱th duëël kuth nikɛ ka̱m raar bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ko-rɛc kuäär Pa-rath ti̱ti̱ ka̱m raar kɛ tet Mith-rɛ-dath tɔ̱ɔ̱w kuakni, mëë cukɛ kuɛn tetdä Cec-bɛ̈-dhar bööth Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu pekdiɛn a,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
